#  Study complexity vs extraction reliability: Pearson's r and Spearman's rho
#  (with permutation-test significance), plus the auxiliary-vs-core
#  correlation and the paired ablation permutation test.
#
#  This reuses the exact paper-matching logic from jaccard_analysis.R
#  (same dev_map / val_map / pkey_dev / pkey_val / hmatch / jaccard
#  functions) so that the per-paper Jaccard values feeding into these
#  correlations are computed the same way as Table 2.

library(readxl)

## File paths
